    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "d61b9123_2979dbbd",
        "filename": "include/private/base/SkTArray.h",
        "patchSetId": 7
      },
      "lineNbr": 434,
      "author": {
        "id": 8341
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-10-16T16:57:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For TArray, this impl is brittle because changeSize() only modifies fSize, it doesn\u0027t actually handle running destructors.  The `move()` call inside shrink_to_fit() will think it has to actually move the potentially unitialized values of the original array into the shrunk array (because here `count` doesn\u0027t necessarily reflect the actual initialized size that shrink_to_fit currently assumes).\n\nGiven that, and for the use case here, where we know the TArray is always empty before we shrink and clear it, we can just remove this and use reserve_exact in the PaintParamsKeyBuilder class.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 434,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 434,
        "endChar": 32
      },
      "revId": "18766c1c211f06c0436f1686b04b3b8be345b897",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "f5732257_cbaf1e44",
        "filename": "include/private/base/SkTDArray.h",
        "patchSetId": 7
      },
      "lineNbr": 229,
      "author": {
        "id": 8341
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-10-16T16:57:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think we can just change UniformManager\u0027s fStorage to be a TArray\u003cchar\u003e instead of TDArray\u003cchar\u003e.  The append() call for TDArray should be identical to TArray\u0027s push_back_n() given that `new char` default initialization should be a no-op so the compiler can remove the entire loop.\n\nWhile TDArray\u0027s shrinkAndClear doesn\u0027t have the same issues with object lifetime as TArray since nothing is ever explicitly initialized/destroyed, shrinkAndClear() is  a pretty unique operation for these builders so if we can generalize part of it (e.g. add a reserve_exact to TDArray so UniformManager uses that and asserts its already cleared), that seems better.  Or we switch UniformManager to consolidate on TArray over TDArray and reuse its reserve_exact impl in both UniformManager and PaintParamsKeyBuilder.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 225,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 229,
        "endChar": 5
      },
      "revId": "18766c1c211f06c0436f1686b04b3b8be345b897",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
